  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div style='text-align:Left;'><p>This Crown land data set includes:</p><ul><li>leases</li><li>licenses of occupation</li><li>land use permits</li><li>beach management agreements</li><li>easements</li></ul><p>These are lands with tenanted dispositions by the Crown that have a term.<br />Dispositions may only occur on lands included in either of the following data classes:</p><ul><li>Crown land: ministry unpatented land</li><li>Crown land: ministry acquisitions</li></ul><p><span>This data is subject to terms of use.</span></p><p><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></p><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Land-Tenure-Data-User-Guide-FINAL-20260415_ENG.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Land Tenure Data - User Guide (Word)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/DD%20Crown%20Land%20-%20MNR%20Non-Freehold%20Dispositions%20(CLDISP)%20(2026-03-26).docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Data Dictionary (Word)</a></li></ul></div><p><strong>Status:&nbsp;</strong><br />On going: data is continually being updated</p><p><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency:</strong><br />Continually</p><div><strong>Contact</strong></div><div>Ministry of Natural Resources, Office of the Surveyor General</div><ul><li><div><a href='mailto:landtenuremapping@ontario.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'>landtenuremapping@ontario.ca</a>&nbsp;</div></li></ul><div><strong>Note</strong><br />Additional features licensed under the Ontario Geospatial Data Exchange (OGDE) Agreement are available to members of the OGDE for professional, non-commercial use only. To find out more about the OGDE visit <a target='_blank' href='https://www.ontario.ca/page/geospatial-ontario' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geospatial Ontario</a> on Ontario.ca.&nbsp;</div></div>"
